### Owner: Lorena  ·  TS07, TS08 sales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Register a sale -> 201 { "id": "R-00042" }
POST {{baseUrl}}/ventas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productoId": 3, "cantidad": 2, "precioUnitario": 5.5 } ] }

### More than the stock -> 422 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK (R13)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ventas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productoId": 1, "cantidad": 999, "precioUnitario": 8.2 } ] }

### Product without sale price (Flour, id 5) -> 422 NO_SALE_PRICE (R14)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ventas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productoId": 5, "cantidad": 1, "precioUnitario": 3 } ] }

### Without items -> 400 NO_ITEMS
POST {{baseUrl}}/ventas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [] }

### History of the month (Historial del mes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ventas?desde=2026-11-01&hasta=2026-11-30

### Detail (with its stock movements)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ventas/R-00041

### Does not exist -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/ventas/R-99999
